<h2 id="nevada-kitchen-design-trends">Nevada Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Las Vegas kitchens skew contemporary and high-contrast — flat-slab and frameless fronts, dramatic stone, integrated lighting, and a glamorous, finished feel suited to the Valley's modern architecture. High-end communities like Summerlin, The Ridges, and MacDonald Highlands push toward handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> and seamless <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> kitchens, while the Reno–Tahoe market blends contemporary with mountain-modern warmth.</p>
